---
// Near the top of every student page, so a lecturer who lands here sees the rules first.
---

<aside class="dodont" aria-labelledby="dodont-heading">
  <h2 id="dodont-heading" class="dodont__label">What I do and don’t do</h2>
  <div class="dodont__cols">
    <div>
      <h3 class="dodont__sub">I do</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Teach and explain methods, statistics and software</li>
        <li>Check your understanding with questions and exercises</li>
        <li>Give feedback on work you have written yourself</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="dodont__sub">I don’t</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Write assignments, dissertations or any part of them for you</li>
        <li>Run your analysis for you to submit</li>
        <li>Do exams, tests or quizzes</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="dodont__foot">
    Your university’s rules come first. Read the full <a href="/academic-integrity">Academic Integrity Policy</a>.
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .dodont {
    margin-block: 2rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);
  }
  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .dodont {
      padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem 1.75rem;
    }
  }
  .dodont__label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .dodont__cols {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 40rem) {
    .dodont__cols {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
  .dodont__sub {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .dodont ul {
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    list-style: disc;
  }
  .dodont li + li {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }
  .dodont li::marker {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .dodont__foot {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
</style>
